00:00:04.833 --> 00:00:07.366 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour Michelle et ses deux

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.233 size:53% position:73% line:53%
enfants. Le repas du

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.133 size:53% position:73% line:53%
