00:01:36.566 --> 00:01:43.500 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour partager leur savoir.

00:01:41.866 --> 00:01:44.400 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Leur chainubububube comptabilise

00:01:42.733 --> 00:01:45.266 size:53% position:73% line:53%
