00:01:45.366 --> 00:01:47.900 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Pour l'instant,

00:01:46.233 --> 00:01:48.766 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ils ne produisent que

00:01:47.133 --> 00:01:49.666 size:53% position:73% line:53%
